usage: run_ab.py [-h] --repo REPO --out OUT --firtool-dir FIRTOOL_DIR
                 --xs-env XS_ENV [--structural-proxy]

Run REAL Chisel/FU A/B in the task's isolated Linux repository only. No model
replacement, handwritten RTL, CPU build, submodule mutation, network setup,
branch publication, or production configuration promotion occurs here. The
explicit experiment patch must already have been applied and reviewed.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --repo REPO
  --out OUT             fresh directory under hardware-runs
  --firtool-dir FIRTOOL_DIR
  --xs-env XS_ENV       actual read-verified existing xs-env root
  --structural-proxy    optional generic Yosys cells; NOT physical PPA
